# Cursor Rules
- Always read `docs/MASTER_CONTEXT.md` for rig state, device map, and audio graph.
- Recreate / operate the working 2ch Channel D path from `docs/RUNBOOK.md`.
- Log session progress in `docs/PROGRESS.md`; keep architecture in MASTER_CONTEXT.
- GitHub remote: https://github.com/ixamal/blackhole (docs + routing notes only — never commit audio, NML, TSI, or master.db).
- Git authorship: commits and PRs must be David alone — never add `Co-authored-by: Cursor`, `Made-with: Cursor`, or any Cursor attribution trailer.
- Never change Audio MIDI Setup / Traktor / Rekordbox settings without a documented rollback.

# Rig
- Machine: David / Mac (Apple Silicon), host `ix`
- Traktor Pro 4.5.1 on S8 (mixer, Channel D live in). S88 MkII is the keyboard into KK / Maschine.
- Rekordbox 7 + DDJ-FLX10 is a stretch goal (MIDI conflict history)
- Library lives in https://github.com/ixamal/music_migration (canned)

# Phases
1. Install/configure BlackHole; prove a clean virtual I/O path.
2. Traktor ↔ S88 MkII only.
3. Add S8 without fighting the S88.
4. Stretch: Rekordbox FLX10 dual-software without RB capturing Traktor MIDI.

# Journal
- Session narrative → docs/PROGRESS.md; architecture → docs/MASTER_CONTEXT.md; how-to → docs/RUNBOOK.md; commits → git log.
